        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 24 at 9:02AM CDT by NWS Milwaukee/Sullivan WI</headline>
        <description>Patchy dense fog will gradually diminish across portions of Sauk,
Columbia, Marquette and Green Lake counties through 11 AM. Be
prepared for rapidly changing visibility on area roadways, with
localized areas of dense fog less than one quarter mile. Fog will
dissipate by 11 AM.
</description>
